MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_001: Hey, watch where you're going! You just bumped\ninto me!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_002: No! What are you talking about?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_003: Don't play dumb! I'm injured. Your fault. You owe\nme—fork over some coins.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_004: Zarcone! Up to something?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_005: Bah! How annoying. Better hoof it!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_006: You! Come back here!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_007: Let me go! I'm the victim here! That lady's a real\nproblem, you know that?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_008: Spare me. You're clearly the offender! Why else\nwould you have run away when you saw me?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_009: What's with you? Got a problem with me or\nsomethin'?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_010: When you allied with us, you said you were\nswearing off crime.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_011: It's not a crime if you don't get caught. Would've\ngotten away if you hadn't blundered in.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_012: Oh, please. The issue here is you not following\nthrough on your promises.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_013: Yeah, yeah, fine. I get the message. I'll turn up\nthe sneaky.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_014: *sigh* There's no helping you, is there?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_015: As you'd clearly prefer a life of crime to being\nour ally, I suppose this is farewell.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_016: What? H-hang on there. That's no good. This is the\nonly thing I've got going!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_017: So, yeah. Sorry, sorry. Forgive me, OK? Please!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_018: How can I possibly trust you, after the bevy of lies\nand misdeeds?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_019: No, I'm serious this time! You gotta believe me!\nI'm begging you!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_020: You know...there's a method of moral refinement\npracticed in the land of Sai.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_021: I wonder if it could refine even your rotten character.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_022: Huh? What are you talking about?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_023: It involves standing in a frigid waterfall until you're\ntotally free of thought—purified in body and mind.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_024: Eugh! That sounds like the worst. Sent a chill\ndown my spine.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_025: I thought you might not like the idea. Ah, just\nas well. Goodbye then.
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_026: No, fine, fine! No problem! I'll do it. You'll keep me\non if I do, right?
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_027: My forgiveness is beside the point! You must show\nremorse. Improvement!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_028: You got it. And I get paid for this improvement\nstuff, right? I mean, fair's fair!
MID_SE_Gat_Zac_C_029: Ahh... Truly a lost cause.